OL,3,AMen guilty of abusing woman drugged and
OL,4,Aadvertised for sex by husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been found guilty of
OL,7,Fsexually abusing a woman whose husband
OL,8,Fdrugged and secretly advertised her for
OL,9,Fsex on the internet.
OL,11,FPhilip Young, 50, already pleaded
OL,12,Fguilty to multiple charges of drugging
OL,13,Fand raping his wife, Joanne Young, over
OL,14,Fa 13-year period at their home in
OL,15,FSwindon, Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
