OL,3,AMyanmar committed genocide against its
OL,4,ARohingya minority, UN's top court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FMyanmar committed genocide against its
OL,7,FRohingya minority population, the
OL,8,FInternational Court of Justice (ICJ)
OL,9,Ffinds
OL,11,FThe verdict - decided by a panel of
OL,12,Fjudges from around the world - is the
OL,13,Ffirst time a state has ever been found
OL,14,Fguilty by an international court of
OL,15,Fcommitting genocide
OL,17,FIn his summarising remarks, Judge Yuji
OL,18,FIwasawa says Myanmar had the "intention
OL,19,Fto destroy" a substantial part of the
OL,20,FRohingya population
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
